        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "88ef7e0f-6221-5298-9132-8dc0b47de410",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nicholas Scibetta, Sammy Gravano, Joseph Zicarelli, John Zicarelli, Gerard Gravano, John Gotti\n- Organizations: Gambino crime family\n- Roles: mobster, mob associate, boss, stool pigeon\n- Topics: family relationships, criminal testimony, murders\n\nFacts:\n- Nicholas Scibetta, also known as Little Nicky, died in 1978.\n- Nicholas Scibetta was a Sicilian American mobster and a Gambino crime family associate.\n- Nicholas Scibetta was the nephew of Joseph Zicarelli and John Zicarelli.\n- Nicholas Scibetta was the brother-in-law of Sammy Gravano and the uncle of Gerard Gravano.\n- Nicholas Scibetta was later marked as a stool pigeon by fellow Gambino crime family members.\n- Sammy Gravano helped bring down Gambino crime family boss John Gotti by agreeing to testify against him and other mobsters.\n- In that deal, Sammy Gravano confessed to involvement in 19 murders.",
